urself on a pine tree? Probably. All for love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/230e2a525156bdae73e176b8dd717579.poster.avif?t=1782941760\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/230e2a525156bdae73e176b8dd717579.webm?t=1782941760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/230e2a525156bdae73e176b8dd717579.mp4?t=1782941760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/fe21638c3c4896906b8e6811b9e52ad5.avif?t=1782941760\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is an option! Because.. You. Will. Always. Fail. Hilariously. You'll get eaten by piranhas, become a moose's new hat, get stuck in a tree, and possibly abducted by a creepy green dude. But hey, at least you'll fail in style. The real question is: how far can you get before you fail spectacularly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e4a2d9730c513affdc0390c203acfee7.poster.avif?t=1782941760\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e4a2d9730c513affdc0390c203acfee7.webm?t=1782941760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e4a2d9730c513affdc0390c203acfee7.mp4?t=1782941760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas